        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-23T23:04:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That was before the split.&nbsp; For whatever reason, when &gt;G was splitting, they chose not to split it twice and make an \"Envisioner's thoughts on social progressiveness\" topic.&nbsp; Thusly, the topic of this thread remains a little broad; it starts with discussion of why I have trouble with Omnitron in Silver Gulch (though someone actually solved that one to my satisfaction; I now have more of a problem with him being in the Realm of Discord, since you'd think scientific laws necessary for a machine to operate would break down a bit in there), but then kinda expanded outward into <em>why</em> I felt that way, and then to my beliefs in general.</p>",
